ps（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609317159211008375169.jpeg/IcWDFd4AMUjVvAl3AW6-3Ra9OKHIFzymXqgN2V6oDdk\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609319835308032968403.jpeg/Jo89yfljYPVNo3vLLyDChzkc0ktxrDw62gBvaNoAb2g\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609322108751872412387.jpeg/gBE2mOySg1Or_EPmAYdCezOvMaXtqlzVC-S6ogvkuqI\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609324172480512389026.jpeg/zCK-8Wa-x6RmkIFpAQ66zyuTub3jPDz1TcQAfE3EAHw\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609326265569280791368.jpeg/hmXGYPr1GmErWn4N9G036WC6VGLBPgyQ4QtjguELY4I\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609328497070080534027.jpeg/FaFSOp570GoStZvpcfVuipgNm6ymatEao7NgqqOzYKo\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609330250420224425678.jpeg/2z8n2M7OMv90hXInakiu1E8os3ztZe1cNMbJkzTGyZM\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609332297371648805341.jpeg/2j8n4B_70vPsHoQxoPIWqVZsobmY8UpmWfUBs1n1AbM\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609305653972992635918.jpeg/oLWgioEuPsQEQY0PFy7dHW57wkfuwEz2m8xPn5vMT58\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609309303148544231046.jpeg/xOVegxlIlzhK3yP3Kb0AuGA66zZzN5OI2BPOVNgTzlQ\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201204/411609311782113280209467.jpeg/ximh_uoGSmYkBqVdxfawdGYs1qrT6oaIyXyeHcl8nh0\"/><figcaption>禦寒保暖8大Tips（HK01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>小心羽絨4大安全隱患</p><p>保暖亦有人選擇穿羽絨，但原來可能有爆炸問題。內地應急管理部宣教中心曾發文，講解穿羽絨服存在的安全隱憂，有4大注意事項，部份情況下甚至可能出現爆炸。</p><p>穿羽絨4大安全隱患：</p><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408097363529728860357.jpeg/NDZaK25zgAmNpwxAHsa3D1mpXvwdgrLGYym6kWMpupE\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408100157067264625871.jpeg/X3xK3WnlvVO-3h59zsrhghMcYGD1hmdbULvAZFC7wGQ\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408102497619968546317.jpeg/6oYUsaw-Vfo1QAbRaBDgq7Q8hcXbP1rMTGEki0xhJIs\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408104771063808960478.jpeg/Mqd2I26AdX1ydJe1m4eo99iiIWdA5GYjA7nBAQO5wQE\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408106977398784643805.jpeg/Z0rxVyncPmp_KHxlJeX_35G1LbO51nJyowUli6MFJYs\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（微博影片截圖／01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201223/418408109443780608798136.jpeg/luQfCT5B8nZydJx4Npsj_LjbICKYK0Afu7hNiru4TYo\"/><figcaption>【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（微博影片截圖／01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"【穿羽絨4大安全隱患】（01製圖）\" src=\